        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-68 (ensure cooperative vendor qualification &amp; settlement integrity.) | - operational: AQL partial-accept, rework path, and root-cause capacity-building (W3117)
Owner: Quality Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
