    <bpmn:process id="W_W3127" name="W3127. Cooperative Advance Financing &amp; Working Capital Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Coop cash-flow need for raw material/labor; advance per contract (W3116)
Frequency: Per PO advance (~30–60% of PO value)
Volume: Per coop PO
Owner: Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Participants: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr, Finance, Treasury (links to VS-18), Legal, Coop Representatives
Source: workflow W3127 — Cooperative Advance Financing &amp; Working Capital Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3127_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3127_Lane1" name="Sustainability Sourcing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3127_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3127_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3127_Lane2" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3127_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3127_Lane3" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3127_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3127_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3127_Start5" name="Coop cash-flow need for raw material/labor; advance per contract (W3116)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3127_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3127_Task6" name="Coop requests advance per contract terms; Sustainability Sourcing Mgr validates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Coop requests advance per contract terms; Sustainability Sourcing Mgr validates against production plan (W3122) and contract; prevent over-advance by netting against open POs
Responsible (R): Sustainability Sourcing Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3127_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3127_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3127_Task7" name="Finance/Treasury disburse advance via direct-to-coop-account (links to VS-18)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Treasury disburse advance via direct-to-coop-account (links to VS-18); record as advance/accrued against PO; Legal confirms advance terms (repayment via set-off on final invoice)
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per advance</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3127_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3127_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3127_Task8" name="At settlement (W3126): AP nets advance from final payment; reconcile to zero…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: At settlement (W3126): AP nets advance from final payment; reconcile to zero; report advance utilization for impact tracking (links to W3129) and capacity-building program (W3117)
Responsible (R): AP Clerk / Sustainability Sourcing Mgr
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Per settlement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3127_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3127_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3127_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3127_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3127_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-512 (ensure controlled execution — Cooperative Purchase Order, Logistics &amp; Livelihood Settlement (PA-94.2).) | - operational: capped advance %, set-off mechanism, and capacity-assessed onboarding (W3115)
Owner: Sustainability Sourcing Manager</bpmn:text>
