    <bpmn:process id="W_W3128" name="W3128. Cooperative Dispute, Short-Shipment &amp; Quality Claim Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quality reject, short-ship, damage-in-transit, invoice discrepancy
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Subset of coop POs
Owner: Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Participants: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr, Quality, AP (links to VS-15), Coop Representatives, Legal
Source: workflow W3128 — Cooperative Dispute, Short-Shipment &amp; Quality Claim Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3128_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3128_Lane1" name="Sustainability Sourcing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3128_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3128_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3128_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3128_Lane2" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3128_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3128_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3128_Start4" name="Quality reject, short-ship, damage-in-transit, invoice discrepancy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3128_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3128_Task5" name="Sustainability Sourcing Mgr documents dispute: evidence (photos, GR record —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr documents dispute: evidence (photos, GR record — W3125, invoice), categorize (quality/quantity/damage/invoice), proposed remedy (rework, replacement, credit, price adjustment)
Responsible (R): Sustainability Sourcing Mgr
Accountable (A): Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3128_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3128_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3128_Task6" name="Engage Coop Representatives with respectful, capacity-building framing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Engage Coop Representatives with respectful, capacity-building framing (root-cause rather than punitive); agree remedy and timeline; for damage-in-transit, file claim with carrier/3PL (links to VS-56/VS-90)
Responsible (R): Sustainability Sourcing Mgr / Coop
Accountable (A): Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3128_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3128_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3128_Task7" name="AP/Finance process credit/replacement; track systemic disputes to drive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AP/Finance process credit/replacement; track systemic disputes to drive capacity-building (W3117); for repeat offenders, escalate to offboarding review (W3120); document resolution
Responsible (R): AP Clerk / Finance / Sustainability Sourcing Mgr
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3128_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3128_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3128_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3128_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3128_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-512 (ensure controlled execution — Cooperative Purchase Order, Logistics &amp; Livelihood Settlement (PA-94.2).) | - operational: fair-trade duty-of-care and root-cause approach
Owner: Sustainability Sourcing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
